  {
    "id": "1935339676946366912",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "需要 Opus 4 的强大能力（如复杂项目、AI 代理、长时间任务），建议选择 Max 计划。\n\n仅做简单开发或小项目，Pro 计划的 Sonnet 4 已足够。\n\nMax 计划支持更高用量和更强模型，适合重度开发者。 https://t.co/RbvjDBMaYI",
    "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:11:50.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 0,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 97,
      "impression_count": 97
    },
    "media": [
      {
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gtuz21QWAAAfKwv.jpg",
        "type": "photo",
        "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gtuz21QWAAAfKwv.jpg"
      }
    ],
