    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1935339672550653995",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1908813846141190144/PeyzcyMF_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "Opus 4：在复杂、长时间、多步骤的编程任务上表现突出，能更好地理解和重构大型代码库，推理和规划能力更强，适合高阶开发者和 AI 代理场景。\n\nSonnet 4：速度快、成本低，适合日常开发、代码审查、修复 bug、实现新功能等高频但不极端复杂的任务。​⁠ https://t.co/VcA5WrNgaT",
    "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:11:49.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 114,
      "impression_count": 114
    },
    "media": [
      {
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GtuzvELbkAA_gfR.jpg",
        "type": "photo",
        "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GtuzvELbkAA_gfR.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "entities": {
